    <elementInformations/>
    <informations>This element was created using my own work while taking inspiration from publicly available CAD models shared by the community.
Special thanks to "Claude ROBERT"  for sharing the "Grove-Shield Arduino Uno" model on GrabCAD, which served as a reference during the design process.
Original model: https://grabcad.com/library/grove-shield-arduino-uno-2
License: see https://www.qelectrotech.org/wiki_new/doc/elements_license</informations>
